        (adelicBox K)) (NumberField.StandardAddChar.stdAddChar K) (rightConv K R.toFun f) 1 (diagOne t₀ * k₀) ≠ 0 := by p2m_exact_reverting @_root_.P2MW.S_AutomorphicForm_SmoothCuspRealizationAt_exists_mem_maximalCompactAt_whittakerCoefficient_rightConv_diagOne_mul_ne_zero.solution
